 a newly resurrected gorgon  various battles ensued between the  secret warriors and hydra  up until secret warriors 25 when kraken  kidnapped fury and struck her  the following issue revealed that kraken  was fury's brother jake who was working  as a double agent  and that fury made struck a think he was  controlling shield when he was actually  working for fury the whole time  after fury executed strucker and secret  warriors 27  gorgon and viper allied with norman  osborne and his hammer organization in  new avengers 16.1  and 17 but they were all defeated viper  then used the remaining hammer troops to  reinforce hydra and avengers 24  but that failed too strucka was a  dominant force in the marvel universe  starting with his first appearance in  1964's  sergeant fury and his howling commandos  5. but the supreme hydra would  eventually meet his demise in 1967  strange tales 158  in that comic fury confronted strucker  on his personal base of operations  hydra island during one of their  encounters fury used hydra's epiderm  mask machine to change struck his face  into furies  the real fury then made two different  struck a mask  when hydra guard saw two struckers  fighting they unmasked one of them to  reveal fury when in actuality  it was struck her wearing a fury mask  nevertheless  struck a panic and indiscriminately  jumped into an alpha particle reactor  cube where he was incinerated  meanwhile the disguised fury escaped  hydra island and detonated strucker's  death spore bio weapon  inside the domed island according to the  data core and fury files in secret  warriors 1  strucker's influence still loomed large  as his supposed death  caused hydra to split into three  factions the leading hydra council of  them  the terrorist organization known as aim  and the hydra subsidiary secret empire  after strucker was resurrected in nick  fury agent of shield 21  he started killing off leaders of  several splinter groups  in order to unite them under a new hydra  